certain sounds. Your peaks are going to be quite strong, but your valleys blurry. A

28
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:25,640
very intuitive aspect of intonation that this practice will help you develop.

29
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:32,980
Articles such as the, uh, are usually very reduced sounds. Before a consonant, the

30
00:02:32,980 --> 00:02:37,980
and uh are both schwa sounds, which are reduced. Before a vowel, however, you'll

31
00:02:37,980 --> 00:02:45,880
notice a change. The schwa of the turns into a long e plus a Y. The book changes

32
